      "domain": "b2b",
      "question_class": "multi_call",
      "question": "Across the TrueNorth Technologies EDA integration discussions with Thierry Dupont, what concern did he raise about security compliance, and what discount did Liam later offer on AIOptics Vision?",
      "gold_answer": "Thierry said security compliance was a key concern given industry issues; Liam later offered a 15% discount on AIOptics Vision.",
      "supporting_call_ids": [
        "b2b:a05Wt000003SvpgIAC",
        "b2b:a05Wt000003T0irIAC"
      ],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "call_id": "b2b:a05Wt000003T0irIAC",
          "answer_claim": "Thierry: \"Security compliance is definitely a key concern for us, especially given some issues we've seen across the industry.\"",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "line_start": 5,
          "line_end": 6,
          "quote": "[2023-09-03T11:00:45] Thierry Dupont: Security compliance is definitely a key concern for us, especially given some issues we've seen across the industry.",
          "start": 864,
          "end": 1018
        },
        {
          "call_id": "b2b:a05Wt000003SvpgIAC",
          "answer_claim": "Liam: \"And with our 15% discount, it represents great value.\" (on AIOptics Vision)",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "line_start": 6,
          "line_end": 7,
          "quote": "[2023-11-01T15:01:05] Liam Kelly: Absolutely, Thierry. We've structured our total cost of ownership to be very transparent to help with your budgeting. For instance, our AIOptics Vision, with its large-scale capability, provides robust integration into your existing workflows without additional overheads. And with our 15% discount, it represents great value.",
          "start": 941,
          "end": 1301
        }
      ]
    },
