          "answer_claim": "Both the Tesla Model S and the Jaguar F-Pace... excel in those areas",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "line_start": 14,
          "line_end": 15,
          "quote": "[2021-01-22T15:50:20] Kaito Nakamura: Both the Tesla Model S and the Jaguar F-Pace, which we've talked about previously, excel in those areas. The Tesla's autopilot features and over-the-air updates are cutting-edge. The Jaguar offers superior safety-rated features and has an infotainment system that keeps everything connected on the go.",
